# Build output and crash artifacts are ephemeral/regenerable; `corpus/` is
# intentionally NOT listed here — the checked-in files under
# `corpus/gguf_parse/` are a small, deliberate set of seed inputs (T-03),
# not fuzzer-discovered growth. A local `cargo fuzz run` will expand this
# directory into thousands of files; do not `git add` that expansion.
target
artifacts
